{
    "title": "HuntSmart: The Trail Cam App",
    "description": "Manage your Wildgame Innovations cellular trail cameras with HuntSmart. View, share, analyze, and configure your trail cameras with ease. Combine weather and solunar data with your photos to spot patterns and game movement like never before. Request near-instant high-definition photos and videos from your camera with On-Demand, providing powerful remote monitoring capabilities. \r\n\r\nExperience the powerful features of HuntSmart with support for the latest Wildgame Innovations cellular trail cameras, utilizing the strength of Verizon and AT&T networks for optimum nationwide coverage. Position your cameras\u2019 locations on a map and better track game movement on your property. Everything you need in a hunting app; the big bucks won\u2019t stand a chance. Hunt smarter. Strategize for effective results. Download HuntSmart today. \r\n\r\n\u25ba HuntSmart App Features \u25ba\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Quick camera setup and activation through HuntSmart \r\n\u25c6 Access and monitor all your Wildgame Innovations cellular trail cameras \r\n\u25c6 Manage your cellular data plans and billing in the app \r\n\u25c6 View high-definition photos and videos directly within the app \r\n\u25c6 AI-driven or manual tagging of images \r\n\u25c6 Download, review, save, and share high-definition photos and videos \r\n\u25c6 Configure your photo transmission times \r\n\u25c6 Share view-only access to your cameras with other HuntSmart users \r\n\u25c6 Advanced filtering of images by date, time of day, weather, location, moon phase, species, and more \r\n\u25c6 Receive push notifications for new photos",
